      "review_summary": "The PR adds Slack authenticated per-chunk delivery metadata, queue dispatch timing and reply-route persistence, and core/channel plumbing so ambiguous final Slack text sends can be reconciled from Slack history before replay.\n\nPR surface: Source +688, Tests +1008. Total +1696 across 24 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source-level reproduction is high-confidence: a mocked Slack history or replies response with has_more true, returned messages, and no next_cursor still exits the scan before the older page, and the bundled Slack setup lacks the metadata-read scope needed for marker visibility.",
